sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant S as Supervisor
    participant E as Engine process
    participant B as Message Bus
    S->>E: launch python3 -u models10.py --only funding_fade
    E->>B: subscribe to its topics
    loop every scan cycle
        E->>B: read inputs (forecast, TA, signals)
        E->>E: compute signal + score
        E->>B: publish model.decision / model.fill
    end
    Note over S,E: if the process dies or hangs
    S->>E: restart (watchdog)
